      "sourceText": "- 单核 CPU 上多个线程轮流执行，这是并发，但不是严格意义上的并行；\n- 多核 CPU 上多个线程同时计算，这是并发，也可能是并行；\n- 一个线程里用协程处理多个网络请求，这是并发，但未必有多个线程；\n- C++ 并行算法可能使用线程池或其他执行机制，但使用者不一定直接管理线程。",
      "translatedText": "- Multiple threads take turns executing on a single\\-core CPU; this is concurrency, but not parallelism in the strict sense;\n- Multiple threads compute simultaneously on a multi\\-core CPU; this is concurrency, and may also be parallelism;\n- Using coroutines within a single thread to handle multiple network requests is concurrency, but does not necessarily involve multiple threads;\n- C++ Parallel algorithms may use thread pools or other execution mechanisms, but users do not necessarily manage threads directly\\.",
